  "description": "When a top actress named Elise is killed by her boyfriend, she gets transmigrated into the villainess of a story she was supposed to star in. But what's this? The man who was supposed to get transmigrated as her partner is too affectionate! Didn't they say he is cold and distant? What happened to the man who was supposed to help me? \n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)\n\n*Notes:\n\\- Includes six extra chapters.\n\\-First released in English, with the initial eligible release in Japanese followed by Korean, making it a manga by our standards.*",
